A drop that names a table schema.sql still makes is a contradiction:
roux-db refuses it, before any app is built.

== before
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;

== after
CREATE TABLE dish (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT NOT NULL) STRICT;
-- @drop table Dish

== error
roux-db: @drop table Dish, but schema.sql makes it
